    "turn_text": "And that's what we are. We're a solutions oriented podcast, your solutions oriented guy. I'm really impressed at, how much you're still doing at this point, how many years after retiring from Congress and what have you. And we're living in a time Dr. Paul did is one of, to me, being about 50 years old, one of the most disturbing periods of time I've ever lived in. And I'm just wondering from your perspective, a few years senior to me, what is the most disturbing part of how people in government have been responding specifically to COVID or anything else in our modern day?",
